<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>What's new on FormaChat</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 40px;">

    <img src="{{emailBannerUrl}}" alt="FormaChat" width="480" style="width:100%; max-width:480px; display:block; margin:32px auto 28px; border:0;">

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 16px;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 28px;">
      It's been a while since we last said hello — and FormaChat has grown a lot since you signed up. Here's everything that's live right now, and a look at what's coming next.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#636b2f; margin:0 0 14px;">What's live right now</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#333333; margin:0 0 28px;">
      1. AI chatbot trained on your own business data - answers customer questions 24/7, not generic responses.<br>
      2. AI-assisted setup - paste your website copy or upload a document and FormaChat drafts your business profile for you.<br>
      3. Live product catalog - photos, prices, and stock counts your chatbot always quotes correctly, in real time.<br>
      4. Document knowledge base - upload PDFs or Word docs and your AI learns from them automatically.<br>
      5. Embeddable chat widget - one snippet, works on any website, fully customizable to match your brand.<br>
      6. Lead capture - every conversation that shares contact info becomes a lead you can follow up on.<br>
      7. Analytics dashboard - sessions, messages, and leads charted over time, with CSV export.<br>
      8. Webhooks - connect FormaChat to your CRM, Zapier, or any tool the moment a lead comes in.<br>
      9. QR code &amp; shareable links - get people chatting with your business in seconds.<br>
      10. Secure account tools - two-factor authentication, magic-link sign-in, and multi-device session management.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#636b2f; margin:0 0 14px;">What's coming next</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#333333; margin:0 0 28px;">
      1. Live streaming responses - answers appear as they're generated.<br>
      2. Multi-language support.<br>
      3. Human handoff for conversations that need a real person.<br>
      4. WhatsApp, Telegram, Instagram, and more.<br>
      5. Simple pricing plans as FormaChat grows with you.<br>
      6. A developer API/SDK for custom integrations.
    </p>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin:0 0 28px;">
      <a href="https://www.formachat.com/#/dashboard" style="display:inline-block; padding:13px 30px; background:#636b2f; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:15px;">Log In &amp; Explore</a>
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#777777; margin:0;">
      Questions or feedback? Just reply to this email, or reach us at <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com" style="color:#636b2f;">support@formachat.com</a>.
    </p>

    <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #636b2f; opacity:0.25; margin:32px 0 20px;">

    <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#999999; margin:0;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.<br>
      You're receiving this because you have a FormaChat account.
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
